  "jcr:description": "The LED light source provides real-time endoscopic visibility and near-infrared fluorescence imaging. This enables you to perform minimally invasive surgery using standard endoscopic visible light as well as visual assessment of vessels, blood flow, related tissue perfusion and biliary anatomy near-infrared imaging. In addition, visualization technology to transilluminate the ureters with our IRIS U-kits is available. ",
